WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Australia is both a continent and a sovereign country surrounded by the Indian and Pacific oceans.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Mount Kosciuszko in New South Wales rises to 2,228 meters in the Snowy Mountains range.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
The Great Barrier Reef stretches 2,300 kilometers as the world's largest living coral reef ecosystem.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:23.000
Indigenous Aboriginal Australian culture honors 65,000 years of heritage with the Didgeridoo instrument.

00:00:23.500 --> 00:00:29.000
Sydney Opera House stands as a 20th-century architectural marvel shaped like billowed sails.

